WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.885
These actions need an agent on a call, and a real call cannot

00:00:06.885 --> 00:00:10.020
be placed on this site, so they are described here.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:14.310
You hear the call on your own soft phone, so keep it open and signed in.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:18.490
On the card of an agent who is on a call, Listen lets

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:21.223
you hear the call while nobody hears you.

00:00:21.223 --> 00:00:24.595
Whisper lets only the agent hear you, to coach them.

00:00:24.595 --> 00:00:27.560
Barge joins the call, and everyone hears you.

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:32.646
Click another mode to change how you are heard, and Stop when you are done.

00:00:32.646 --> 00:00:34.680
Only your part of the call ends.

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:39.230
An agent who has paused the recording to take card details cannot be monitored.

